      {
        "id": "pd_note",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          0,
          380
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "## Pictures in a table\n\nPictures held as **base64 text** — or raw SVG — drawn in the table. Each\ntable's rules are in **Properties ▸ Conditional formatting**, or press\n**Rules…**:\n\n* **Beside a value** — `Company image from Logo hide` puts each logo next to\n  its name and hides the base64 column; `circle` turns the owner photos\n  into avatars. The Status icons are base64 SVGs pasted into an icon map.\n* **A column's own pictures** — `Logo image rounded on white`; a picture\n  with no size fills its row, so `height 52` makes them bigger.\n* **Tiles** — `on #2b2f3a` puts a coloured tile behind a picture.\n* **Litware** has no logo yet: a value that isn't a picture shows as text.\n* Try it in **Rules… ▸ Add rule ▸ Icons**: map a value, and paste a\n  picture's base64 (or `<svg>…</svg>`) into the icon cell.\n* The **Report** page prints two of the tables.\n",
          "width": 460,
          "height": 400
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null
      },
      {
        "id": "pd_beside",
        "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
        "pos": [
          620,
          0
        ],
        "params": {
          "format_rules": "# Pictures from another column, beside a value like an icon\nCompany     image from Logo hide\nOwner       image circle from \"Owner photo\" hide\n# Badge holds raw SVG markup: it is drawn in place of the text\nBadge       image\n# Pasted pictures (base64 SVG) in an icon map\nStatus      iconmap circle: on , late=PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCI+PGNpcmNsZSBjeD0iMTIiIGN5PSIxMiIgcj0iMTEiIGZpbGw9IiNlMGE4M2QiLz48cGF0aCBkPSJNMTIgNnY2bDQgMyIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjZmZmIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjIuNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIi8+PC9zdmc+, blocked=PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCI+PGNpcmNsZSBjeD0iMTIiIGN5PSIxMiIgcj0iMTEiIGZpbGw9IiNkOTUzNGYiLz48cGF0aCBkPSJNOCA4bDggOE0xNiA4bC04IDgiIHN0cm9rZT0iI2ZmZiIgc3Ryb2tlLXdpZHRoPSIyLjYiIHN0cm9rZS1saW5lY2FwPSJyb3VuZCIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\nRevenue     format ,.0f\nheight 30\n",
          "hide": "",
          "width": 760,
          "height": 330,
          "scale": 100
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": "Beside a value"
      },
      {
