          "format_rules": "# A picture on a coloured tile, cut to a shape — the Tailspin logo is a\n# letter on a clear ground, which a tile gives a ground to\nCompany     image right 26px circle on #2b2f3a from Logo hide\nStatus = late => icon PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCI+PGNpcmNsZSBjeD0iMTIiIGN5PSIxMiIgcj0iMTEiIGZpbGw9IiNlMGE4M2QiLz48cGF0aCBkPSJNMTIgNnY2bDQgMyIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjZmZmIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjIuNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIi8+PC9zdmc+ right 22px\nStatus = blocked => row #3a1e1e\nhide \"Owner photo\", Badge\n",
          "hide": "",
          "width": 760,
          "height": 300,
